  "description": {
   "en": "Kim Muryeong is the youngest member of a famous exorcist family. He grew up receiving love from his entire family and was considered a genius. The kind that appears once every hundred years. \"Muryeong, let me make a request.\" After enrolling in high school, Muryeong began to do simple exorcism work. The apartment’s elevator is acting weird. Someone is having constant nightmares. Even things like getting rid of a stalker or acting as a boyfriend. It was more of a problem-solver job than exorcism, But Muryeong, being someone who helped anybody, There was nothing he couldn’t accept. But even for Muryeong, there was one person he avoided… \"Ki Hwanyoung?\" Tall and handsome with a mysterious, intimidating aura, And known for being impolite and having no friends. One day, Ki Hwanyoung came to see Muryeong. \"My shoulders feel heavy lately.\"\n\nNovel \u003c Ridibooks \u003e : \nhttps://ridibooks.com/books/297039702\n\nWebtoon \u003c Ridibooks \u003e :\n\u003c R19 \u003e : https://ridibooks.com/books/1746024386\n\u003c R15 \u003e : https://ridibooks.com/books/1746024401"
  },
